(ii) Executive Committee constituted under section 5AA of the Employees' Provident Funds and Miscellaneous Provisions Act, 1952 (19 of 1952);
(iii) the Corporation established under section 3 of the Employees' State Insurance Act, 1948 (34 of 1948);
