3. Definitions.
In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires,
(a) "animals" means animals useful to human beings and includes fish and fowl, and such kinds of wild life as the Central Government may, by notification in the Official Gazette, specify, being kinds which, in its opinions, it is desirable to protect or preserve;
