(e) the form in which and the time within which the Authority shall prepare its budget under section 19 and its annual report under section 22;
(f) the manner in which the Authority may invest its funds under section 20;
(g) the manner in which the accounts of the Authority shall be maintained and audited and the date before which the audited copy of the accounts together with the auditor's report thereon shall be furnished to the Central Government under section 23;
